          <p class="lead" style="margin:0.9rem 0 1.2rem">A "from" price to start, then a fixed quote for your scope before we build — you pay for the outcome, not the hours.</p>
          <p class="callout"><strong>Start with R500.</strong> The deposit is credited toward your project price. We confirm the final scope and fixed price before development begins, so there are no surprises.</p>
