          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem">A live site needs hosting — from R400/year to stay online (short-term for events). You own your domain. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing.html#care">See plans</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <ul class="price-list">
